TASK-184 runtime harness: the command palette's height and row count across
keystrokes and the three list passes (instant, history, search suggestions),
and a late pass against a row selected with the arrow keys. Temporary code,
never committed to Detour/. Apply, build, run, revert:

    git apply docs/harness/task184-harness.patch
    xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    OUT="$PWD/.derived-logs/task184"; mkdir -p "$OUT"
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify184 DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR="$OUT" \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    # wait for the "done:" line in $OUT/verify.log (about 15 s), then kill that pid;
    # "SHOOT <windowNumber>" starts a 2 s pause for `screencapture -x -o -l <windowNumber>`
    git apply -R docs/harness/task184-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

Seeds three sleeping youtube.com tabs and history for eight "y…" hosts, opens
the palette (Cmd+T, default list), types "youtu" key by key, deletes back to
the empty field, types "zqxw" (no matches: only the verbatim row), then clears
it, types "yo" and presses Down twice before the late passes land. A 60 Hz
timer logs the glass container's window frame and the row count whenever
either changes; the last line counts height changes and samples with fewer
than six rows.

Results (2026-10-24): before, 9 height changes (box 78 to 258 pt) and short
lists throughout; with the fixed height alone, 0 changes but "zqxw" showed one
row over blank space; with filler rows, 0 changes, 0 short samples, "zqxw"
shows its row and five recent pages, and the arrowed-to row and the field were
unchanged 1.5 s later.

